        "date": "2026-02-05T13:39:34Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(data): correct extension check in Zabha instruction operation() blocks\n\nThe layout templates for atomic memory operations were incorrectly checking\nfor ExtensionName::A in all generated instructions, including byte and\nhalfword variants that belong to the Zabha extension. This fix updates the\n9 layout templates to dynamically check for the correct extension based on\noperand size:\n\n- Byte (b) and halfword (h) operations now check ExtensionName::Zabha\n- Word (w) and doubleword (d) operations continue to check ExtensionName::A\n\nRegenerated 72 Zabha instruction YAML files with the corrected operation()\nblock.",
