      },
      "message": "refactor: use reserved_instruction for misa.A runtime disable check\n\nPer review discussion in the UDB PR meeting, the operation() check for\nmisa.A disabling atomics should only handle the runtime disable case,\nnot the \"not implemented\" case (which is already handled by definedBy).\n\nChanges:\n- Add reserved_instruction() function to globals.isa that either traps\n  or enters unpredictable state based on TRAP_ON_UNIMPLEMENTED_INSTRUCTION\n- Update all 9 Zaamo layout templates to use the new check pattern:\n  `if (implemented?(ExtensionName::A) && MISA_CSR_IMPLEMENTED && CSR[misa].A == 1'b0)`\n- Regenerate all 144 affected instruction YAML files (72 Zaamo + 72 Zabha)",
      "tree": {
